OL,6,GThese are the main features of BMX:    
OL,8,G* Based on VICE 3.10 (C64, C128, VIC20,
OL,9,GPlus/4 and PET machines are supported) 
OL,10,G* Circle v20, Step 51 to support the   
OL,11,GRaspberry Pi4/5 family * Pi5/Pi500 HDMI
OL,12,Gmodesetting with RGB565 framebuffer and
OL,13,Ghardware scaling, providing            
